          <a class="guide-link" href="/prineville/">Prineville</a>
          <a class="guide-link" href="/madras/">Madras</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Living in Sisters</h2>
        <p>
          Sisters appeals to people who want Central Oregon scenery and outdoor access
          with a smaller-town feel. It is quieter than Bend, but still close enough for
          regional errands, airport access, events, and larger services.
        </p>

        <p>
          The tradeoff is that housing can be expensive, services are more limited, and
          the town can feel very busy during major events. Still, for many people, the
          mountain views, slower pace, and strong local identity are exactly the point.
        </p>
      </section>
